sequenceDiagram
    actor NOC as NOC (Network Operations Center)
    participant FE as Frontend
    participant BE as Backend
    participant DB as Database

    Note over NOC,DB: HKN-001: Melakukan Autentikasi Login

    NOC->>FE: Input username & password
    activate FE
    FE->>BE: POST /api/auth/login
    activate BE
    BE->>DB: Query validasi kredensial
    activate DB
    DB-->>BE: Return data user
    deactivate DB
    
    alt Kredensial Valid
        BE-->>FE: Return token & user info
        deactivate BE
        FE-->>NOC: Redirect ke Dashboard
        deactivate FE
    else Kredensial Invalid
        BE-->>FE: Return error message
        deactivate BE
        FE-->>NOC: Tampilkan pesan error
        deactivate FE
    end
